{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:d818269485840eb9","name":"OOM-Series Battle Droid Squad","source":{"id":"source:reference-d818269485840eb9","title":"OOM-Series Battle Droid Squad","revision":23850,"timestamp":"2024-10-07T14:04:55Z","sha256":"629f74d36632b0b70e6c793c5a3169307f82d0b71e3984001be077ace8e58f6c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=23850","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=OOM-Series%20Battle%20Droid%20Squad&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-d818269485840eb9","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Trade Federation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Trade_Federation","referenceId":"reference:fb5a14e3938c63ab"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Confederacy of Independent Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Confederacy_of_Independent_Systems","referenceId":"reference:dfc46c9d666b9b41"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["OOM-Series Battle Droids are originally designed by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Neimoidians"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Neimoidians"}," to serve as crew aboard Trade Federation vessels. Yellow-striped OOM commanders oversee operations, blue-striped OOM pilots fly the ships, and red-striped OOM security forces protect vital areas. While not as effective as living crews, they require almost no day-to-day maintenance and consume little energy, and defective Droids can be deactivated and replaced within minutes- all very important considerations to the cost-conscious Trade Federation.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Although technically superior to (and less expensive than) their replacements, the ",{"tag":"a","children":["B1-Series Battle Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/B1-Series_Battl